    "en": "Hyou; Dawn Rain"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Hyo-woo is hated everywhere because of his eyes. He is saved by Sa-Gang and he settles in his village. The villagers are waiting for rain because of the frequent drought, and when they see Hyo-woo's eyes, they accuse him of causing the drought. Hyo-woo develops a soft spot for Sa-gang, who is the only person who looks at him kindly amidst the hatred. But Sagang, who hates rain rituals so much, starts holding rain rituals after Hyo-woo's arrival. People gossip that he did it because of Hyo-woo... Hyo-woo's confidence in himself is shaken by the rumors he hears from various parties."
  },
